      "reason": "README 将快速冷启动列为典型使用场景，并把 ModelExpress 说明为面向新副本冷启动加速的能力。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-model-cache-doc",
      "path": "docs/kubernetes/model-caching.md",
      "lines": "8-14,74-92",
      "reason": "模型缓存文档说明通过共享 PVC 只下载一次模型，并可同时供 worker 与 frontend 复用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-model-cache-download",
      "path": "docs/kubernetes/model-caching.md",
      "lines": "35-72",
      "reason": "下载 Job 将 Hugging Face 模型内容拉到共享 PVC，形成缓存预热入口。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-model-cache-spec",
      "path": "deploy/operator/api/v1beta1/dynamographdeploymentrequest_types.go",
      "lines": "257-272",
      "reason": "DGDR v1beta1 通过 ModelCacheSpec 暴露 PVC 名称、模型路径和挂载路径，说明模型缓存是正式编排能力。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-model-cache-mount",
      "path": "deploy/operator/internal/controller/dynamographdeploymentrequest_controller.go",
      "lines": "1229-1238,1503-1513",
      "reason": "controller 读取 model cache 配置并把 PVC 以只读方式挂到生成的 Job/Pod，落实共享缓存职责。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-model-express-doc",
      "path": "docs/kubernetes/model-caching.md",
      "lines": "114-145",
      "reason": "文档将 ModelExpress 定义为 P2P 模型分发服务，下载一次后经网络向所有 pod 分发权重，并通过 mx-source/mx-target 接入 worker 加载链路。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-model-express-inject",
      "path": "deploy/operator/internal/dynamo/graph.go",
      "lines": "953-957",
      "reason": "operator 在平台配置了 ModelExpress URL 时，自动向组件 pod 注入 MODEL_EXPRESS_URL。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-model-express-env",
      "path": "lib/runtime/src/config/environment_names.rs",
      "lines": "317-324",
      "reason": "运行时将 MODEL_EXPRESS_URL 作为正式模型加载环境变量常量管理。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-front-bootstrap",
      "path": "docs/components/frontend/README.md",
      "lines": "44-50",
      "reason": "frontend 负责预处理/后处理，需要 config/tokenizer 等模型配置文件；这些文件可直接从 Hugging Face 下载，也建议通过共享目录复用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-front-register",
      "path": "docs/components/frontend/README.md",
      "lines": "44-45",
      "reason": "frontend 在 worker 调用 register_model 后自动发现后端模型，构成新副本进入服务面的关键接点。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-backend-worker",
      "path": "components/src/dynamo/common/backend/README.md",
      "lines": "25-30",
      "reason": "统一 backend worker 的职责包含启动引擎后注册模型并对外提供 generate endpoint。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-checkpoint-config",
      "path": "deploy/operator/api/v1alpha1/common.go",
      "lines": "233-256",
      "reason": "服务级 checkpoint 配置要求在启用时显式指定 checkpointRef 或 identity，说明恢复路径由编排层声明控制。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-checkpoint-cr",
      "path": "deploy/operator/api/v1alpha1/dynamocheckpoint_types.go",
      "lines": "121-157",
      "reason": "DynamoCheckpoint CR 以 identity、job 和 status.phase/identityHash 表达检查点编目与生命周期。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-checkpoint-auto",
      "path": "deploy/operator/internal/controller/dynamographdeployment_controller.go",
      "lines": "1341-1354",
      "reason": "DGD controller 在 Auto 模式且未显式给 checkpointRef 时，会创建或复用 DynamoCheckpoint。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-snapshot-doc",
      "path": "docs/kubernetes/snapshot.md",
      "lines": "7-20,29-35",
      "reason": "Snapshot 文档给出快速启动的核心逻辑：先冷启动并做 checkpoint，再从现成 checkpoint 恢复后续 worker。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-snapshot-storage",
      "path": "docs/kubernetes/snapshot.md",
      "lines": "96-107",
      "reason": "Snapshot chart 通过共享 RWX PVC 提供 checkpoint 存储，支撑跨节点恢复。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-snapshot-restore-target",
      "path": "docs/kubernetes/snapshot.md",
      "lines": "184-227",
      "reason": "文档展示 Ready 的 DynamoCheckpoint 通过 checkpointRef 被 DGD 显式引用，worker 从现成 checkpoint 恢复而非重新冷启动；Auto 模式则可按 identity 自动查找/创建。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-snapshot-auto-doc",
      "path": "docs/kubernetes/snapshot.md",
      "lines": "224-227",
      "reason": "Auto 模式由 operator 计算 identity hash、查找等价 DynamoCheckpoint，并在缺失时后台创建。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev-snapshot-lifecycle",
      "path": "components/src/dynamo/common/utils/snapshot.py",
      "lines": "29-70,115-141",
      "reason": "snapshot helper 在 worker 内部显式执行 quiesce、ready file、checkpoint/restore watcher 信号，以及 checkpoint 模式下的通信环境调整。"
    }
  ],
  "uncertainties": [
    "ModelExpress 主要实现位于外部仓库 ai-dynamo/modelexpress；本仓库只保留接入常量、operator 注入和文档，因此将其建模为 external。",
    "frontend 是否直接从 ModelExpress 读取配置文件，在当前仓库证据中未被明确写实；模型供给到 frontend 的关系仅锚定到 Hugging Face 或共享 PVC。",
    "Checkpoint 编目与快照卷之间的“索引”关系来自 CR/status 与文档流程合并推断，故标记为 inferred。"
  ],
  "omissions": [
    "未展开 Planner、KV-aware routing、KVBM、故障迁移、LoRA、多模态等与 UC06 无直接必要关系的能力。",
    "未细分具体后端实现（vLLM/SGLang/TRT-LLM）内部类或目录结构，因为它们不改变本用例下的稳定逻辑边界。",
    "未建模 snapshot-agent、placeholder image、CRIU/cuda-checkpoint 为独立一层能力节点，以避免把逻辑视图退化为实现清单。"
  ]
